note.summary:
Common types: string, number, bool, list(string), map(string), object({...}).

Example:
variable "instance_count" {
  type    = number
  default = 1
}

Example:
variable "environment" {
  type    = string
  default = "dev"
}

Convenient for learning; production defaults need caution.

Example:
variable "api_token" {
  type      = string
  sensitive = true
}

Use secret managers/CI secrets and protect state.

Example:
locals {
  name_prefix = "${var.environment}-app"
}

Use as local.name_prefix for tags/names.

Example:
output "bucket_name" {
  value = var.bucket_name
}

Outputs connect Terraform to other tools and reporting.
